                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm going to be completely honest about this game. It is a janky 2006 piece of shit, with a smear of charm across all chapters. Even with the questionablely long save zones, & the awful platforming mechanics this game manages to still have my interest, but especially my heart. If you love western games this is a must have, just beware and understand that this game is of another time, it won't hold your hand. On top of all things is an enticing story with dual protaganists with complex characters. \r\nHighly reccomend for cowboys looking for a new game to play.",
